<title>FRANCE: French 98 budget bill to cabinet 3rd week of Sept.</title>
<headline>French 98 budget bill to cabinet 3rd week of Sept.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's 1998 budget bill will go to cabinet for approval &quot;in the third week of September&quot;, government spokeswoman Catherine Trautmann said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Socialist Prime Minister Lionel Jospin will take final decisions on the spending share accorded to ministries on August 8 and send budget ceiling letters to ministers on August 12, Trautmann said.</p>
<p>She was speaking after the last weekly cabinet meeting before a brief summer break.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
